      "title": "Israeli police detain 10 people in rare raid against West Bank settlers",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/19/israeli-police-detain-10-people-in-rare-raid-against-west-bank-settlers",
      "description": "<p>Move comes after US photojournalist and group of European diplomats and Palestinians were assaulted in separate attacks</p><p>Israeli police have detained 10 people in a rare raid against settlers, after a weekend of extreme violence in the occupied West Bank including an attack on US photojournalist <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/18/us-ambassador-israel-mike-huckabee-west-bank-settler-attack-photojournalist-heidi-levine\">Heidi Levine</a>, which she described as an “attempted lynching”.</p><p>She was knocked down, kicked and beaten by a group of masked Israeli men as she covered the olive harvest in a Palestinian village on Friday. The militants broke four vertebrae and a rip, ripped open her finger so it required surgery and left her with lacerations across her body.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/19/israeli-police-detain-10-people-in-rare-raid-against-west-bank-settlers\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-19T18:05:14"
    },
